    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "From a number here to the trade behind it",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Metrics carry **no domain identifiers** \u2014 by design, and a test enforces it. The navigation path is:\n\n1. notice a change here;\n2. open the **Tempo** trace for the operation;\n3. read `trading.execution.id` / `trading.position.id` / `trading.exit.id` off the span;\n4. open the immutable artifact: `execution explain --execution-id \u2026`, `exit explain --position-id \u2026`, `pnl show --position-id \u2026`.\n\nStep 4 leaves Grafana on purpose. The artifact is the audit record; this stack navigates *to* it and never replaces it."
      }
    }
